      "npc" : "F_Itin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Try again later.  A recent server reboot or rehash has messed the itinerary up for a bit.",
      "translation" : "請稍後再試。伺服器最近重啟或重新載入配置，導致時刻表暫時出現了問題。"
